that their house sells.

226
00:10:15,239 --> 00:10:17,241
-If the buyer's house sells?
-Yeah.

227
00:10:17,325 --> 00:10:19,160
So it's not just a straight offer.

228
00:10:19,493 --> 00:10:21,078
